  "interpretation": "All five controlled faults caused automatic fallback and all five runs returned automatically to ESP-NOW. Detection time stayed within 6.656-10.179 seconds as expected from two 5-second windows and the phase of fault injection. UDP application-ACK success was 92.093% overall.",
  "direction_observation": "The ESP8266-to-ESP32-S3 direction recovered consistently in about 15 seconds. In the ESP32-S3-to-ESP8266 direction, two of three runs required about 52-55 seconds because intermediate recovery windows remained below 90%; more repetitions are needed before claiming a directional effect.",
  "scope_limitation": "The experiment validates the decision algorithm using controlled application-ACK suppression. It does not by itself characterize physical attenuation, interference range, or complete node failure."
